// Squirrel: If you ever manage to catch a Tophat Squirrel, a certain dapper critter might move in!
// LumberJack: The LumberJack loves trees, chop down enough of them and he might just fall out of one!
// Deviantt: Deviantt loves to provide helpful monster spawners, for a hefty cost...
// Abominationn: Defeat the Goblin Army, and a pumpkin headed Abominationn will fall from the sky!
// Mutant: Mutant is always in search of someone strong. Grow in power and you might catch his attention...
// UnlimitedPotions: Collect 30 of a potion and enable Unlimited Buffs to gain that buff permanently!
// Minibridge: Instabridges are a great way to quickly build arenas!
// SemiOmnistation: Arena buffs can be compacted into a Semistation for easy placement - and in hardmode, an Omnistation!
// SquirrelCrunch: The Squirrel is one hungry boy! Feed him and he'll pay you back for your trouble.
// DisableDash: Double-tap dashes can be toggled in the Fargo's Mutant Mod configs!
// BugNet: A bug net can quickly relocate your town NPCs!
